The Software has been registered with the Agence pour la Protection des Programmes (APP) under IDDN.FR.001.270044.000.S.P.2024.000.31235.
The Software is still currently being developed. It is the establishments' aim for the Software to be used by the scientific community so as to test it and evaluate it so that the establishments may improve it.
For these reasons the establishments have decided to distribute the Software. The establishments grant to the academic user, free of charge and without the right to sublicense, a non-exclusive right to use the Software for research purposes. Any other use without prior consent of the establishments is prohibited. The academic user explicitly acknowledges having received from the establishments all information allowing him to appreciate the adequacy of the Software to his needs and to undertake all necessary precautions for its execution and use.
The Software is provided only as source code. In case of using the Software for a publication or other results obtained through the use of the Software, the user should cite the Software as follows:

M.Boussena, F.Monville , J.Fieschi-Meric , F.Vely , P.Milpied , J.Mazieres , M.Perol , E.Vivier6 , L.Greiller, F.Barlesi and S.Benzekry. MSB : Multimodality Stacking with Blockwise missing values.

Every user of the Software could communicate to the developers of MSB (mohamed.boussena@inria.fr, sebastien.benzekry@inria.fr) his or her remarks as to the use of the Software.

